  "description": "Xometry hits another all-time high as our position crosses +45%. Where my mind is going into next week.",
  "body_html": "<p>After a very boring early start to the week, the Stock Market finally woke up Thursday and Friday. Retail investors were predominantly concerned about rising oil prices and Treasury yields pushing up. Despite these “concerns”… and I know it feels weird… I have remained steadfast that not only is the bull market still well intact, but that we will have yet another bull leg upwards to all time highs. These issues will come to fruition in the markets at some point, I am not ignoring them. I pay attention to the headlines, but I don't let them override what the market itself is telling us. Right now, the trend remains up and trend is our friend.</p><p>Our Xometry position hit another all-time high this week, pushing our gain above 45%. Even better, we've been able to add to the position three separate times as the trend continued. That's exactly the type of longer-term winner I'm trying to find and why I'm much more interested in following price action than panicking to every headline.</p><p>Thank you to everyone who participated in the StockTok Survey. Your responses helped me improve the content and our community.  <strong>you want more help with entries, exits, and knowing what to actually do with the stocks we find.</strong></p><p>If you missed anything, these are the <strong>3 updates I would make sure you read before Monday:</strong></p><p><strong>Updated StockTok Summary — Entry &amp; Exit Criteria </strong><br>I completely updated the Summary Page, including the criteria I’m using to determine when I’m interested in entering—and when it’s time to get out.<br><strong>→ <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/the-stocktok-summary?r=4z8lgl\">See the Updated StockTok Summary (Click Here)</a></strong></p><p><strong>When I Plan to Sell My Stocks</strong><br>I broke down how I’m thinking approaching exits, taking profits, and when I believe it’s time to move on.<br><strong>→ <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/yes-i-think-a-market-meltdown-is?r=4z8lgl\">Read My Exit Strategy</a></strong></p><p><strong>3 Stocks I’m Looking to Buy Next</strong><br>Xometry is now up more than 45%. So what’s next? I went back through our previous Midweek Movers winners and identified <strong>3 stocks that have my attention, along with the entry ranges I’m watching.</strong><br><strong>→ <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/3-midweek-mover-winner-stocks-im?r=4z8lgl\">See the 3 Stocks + Entry Ranges</a></strong></p><p>Take some time off, away from the charts. Do something fun. This is so important, to stay fresh. If you come in Monday, grumpy and tired, you are more likely to make poorer decisions. If you ever have questions, feel free to tag me <em>during market hours</em> in the<strong> <a href=\"https://open.substack.com/chat/posts/d18286d6-5152-4f20-85c8-cedb68ee0e71\">Main Chat</a></strong>. Always happy to explain some of the crazy 🤪 things I say on the internet. We have an incredibly collaborative group of investors and traders, and we all focus on helping each other.</p><p>I’ll see you Monday, and thanks for stopping by!</p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe now&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?\"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p><h4><strong>If you like this week’s content, please like ❤️and re-stack 🔄 this post!</strong></h4><div class=\"captioned-button-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/what-im-buying-when-im-selling-and?utm_source=substack&utm_medium=email&utm_content=share&action=share&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Share&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CaptionedButtonToDOM\"><div class=\"preamble\"><p class=\"cta-caption\">Know someone into investing? Share this post with them!</p></div><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/what-im-buying-when-im-selling-and?utm_source=substack&utm_medium=email&utm_content=share&action=share&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Share&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/what-im-buying-when-im-selling-and?utm_source=substack&utm_medium=email&utm_content=share&action=share\"><span>Share</span></a></p></div><p></p>",
